text:
Dear Team, I just had dinner at your restaurant. Unfortunately, I have to tell you that the rösti didn't meet my expectations at all. They were more like patties with a sticky substance. The waiter was extremely unfriendly and didn't even ask if we enjoyed our meal. We wanted to use the restroom before leaving, but he blocked our way and asked what we wanted. Only after I told him we had eaten dinner did he move aside.

All in all, it wasn't a successful birthday evening.










































































































